{
  "$comment": "Hand-written data for capabilities.json (schema: docs/capabilities.md). Edit this file when a capability changes, then run node scripts/whats-new.mjs. When Windows leaves test (CI WIN32_RELEASE=release), change its status and tag here too. Versions, DSH range, office-kit, skills and style packs are read from their own files, not written here.",
